there is a <u>huge catalogue of tiled wall's as well as floorings</u>, that show-off reflections. Decent focus has been put on choosing the right combinations of <u>indoor-outdoor lighting</u>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856320/extras/a8681efbfaf4c04e1ed9a745aa03e551.poster.avif?t=1754809526\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856320/extras/a8681efbfaf4c04e1ed9a745aa03e551.webm?t=1754809526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856320/extras/a8681efbfaf4c04e1ed9a745aa03e551.mp4?t=1754809526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INSPIRATIONS:</strong>\u00a0Built by solo developer using Unreal engine 5, my faith and inspiration came by case-studying  <strong>'Pools by Tensori', 'Anemoiapolis: Chapter 1 by Andrew Quist' and 'Dreamcore by Montraluz', the backroom's lure.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856320/extras/a4388ed08e1d10a2381e999ef6cfc08e.poster.avif?t=1754809526\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856320/extras/a4388ed08e1d10a2381e999ef6cfc08e.webm?t=1754809526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856320/extras/a4388ed08e1d10a2381e999ef6cfc08e.mp4?t=1754809526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYTIME:</strong>\u00a0<u>Min. 1 Hour 20 Minutes up to 2 hours 45 minutes</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOUNDTRACK:</strong> Just the sound of distant water drip's and footstep echo's are heard through and through. The project uses AI generated sound for hardly twenty seconds at the end of the gameplay.</p>",
    "short_description": "A loner's journey by foot is about to get lonelier and lengthier! Liminal Salvation puts you in a vast labyrinth of pools where finding the exit route will require absolute patience &amp; zeal. Can you make it to the very end... or out of deep conflict, give up the ghost?",
